<para>Enum <ref refid="group__sl__bt__connection_1ga817c9d6f24d206939cbd02f82c1313a7" kindref="member">sl_bt_connection_tx_power_flag_t</ref>. Transmit power level flags. Ignore this field if <computeroutput>power_level</computeroutput> is set to 0x7E or 0x7F. Values:<itemizedlist>
